{"data": {"node": {"__typename": "Teacher", "avgDifficulty": 4.3, "avgRating": 2.3, "courseCodes": [{"courseCount": 1, "courseName": "ALLALL"}, {"courseCount": 1, "courseName": "BUS3115"}, {"courseCount": 2, "courseName": "COM1075"}, {"courseCount": 1, "courseName": "COM1825"}, {"courseCount": 3, "courseName": "COM3108"}, {"courseCount": 1, "courseName": "COM3451"}, {"courseCount": 1, "courseName": "GLENNY101"}, {"courseCount": 16, "courseName": "SPE1075"}, {"courseCount": 3, "courseName": "SPE1825"}, {"courseCount": 2, "courseName": "SPEHNRS"}], "department": "Communication", "departmentId": "10", "firstName": "Jackie", "id": "VGVhY2hlci0xNjc3MTc4", "isProfCurrentUser": false, "isSaved": false, "lastName": "Glenny", "legacyId": 1677178, "lockStatus": "none", "numRatings": 31, "ratings": {"edges": [{"cursor": "YXJyYXljb25uZWN0aW9uOjA=", "node": {"__typename": "Rating", "adminReviewedAt": "2025-11-14 20:35:38 +0000 UTC", "attendanceMandatory": "mandatory", "clarityRating": 1, "class": "SPE1075", "comment": "Before coming into this class, I would say that I was a fairly confident speaker and was looking forward to improving my skills, however I feel like this class did the opposite. Glenny is an incredibly picky and biased professor and grader. She makes it obvious that she favors the men in that class and made passive agressive comments to the women.", "createdByUser": false, "date": "2025-11-14 20:35:17 +0000 UTC", "difficultyRating": 5, "flagStatus": "UNFLAGGED", "grade": "B+", "helpfulRating": 1, "id": "UmF0aW5nLTQxODcwMzIw", "isForCredit": true, "isForOnlineClass": false, "legacyId": 41870320, "ratingTags": "Tough grader--Lots of homework", "teacherNote": null, "textbookUse": 3, "thumbs": [], "thumbsDownTotal": 0, "thumbsUpTotal": 2, "wouldTakeAgain": null}}, {"cursor": "YXJyYXljb25uZWN0aW9uOjE=", "node": {"__typename": "Rating", "adminReviewedAt": "2025-04-11 03:04:54 +0000 UTC", "attendanceMandatory": "mandatory", "clarityRating": 1, "class": "COM1075", "comment": "Please avoid at all costs. There are other public speaking professors to choose from. \n\nDr. Glenny is unkind, strict, and not gracious. She speaks in a demeaning manner to her students and is often rude. She takes off a lot of points for small mistakes. I heard her make sexist and anti-Semitic remarks. \n\nI and my friends were truly scared of her. ", "createdByUser": false, "date": "2025-04-11 03:04:34 +0000 UTC", "difficultyRating": 5, "flagStatus": "UNFLAGGED", "grade": "A", "helpfulRating": 1, "id": "UmF0aW5nLTQwOTE3OTk3", "isForCredit": true, "isForOnlineClass": false, "legacyId": 40917997, "ratingTags": "Tough grader", "teacherNote": null, "textbookUse": 3, "thumbs": [], "thumbsDownTotal": 0, "thumbsUpTotal": 2, "wouldTakeAgain": null}}, {"cursor": "YXJyYXljb25uZWN0aW9uOjI=", "node": {"__typename": "Rating", "adminReviewedAt": "2025-04-08 02:01:56 +0000 UTC", "attendanceMandatory": "mandatory", "clarityRating": 2, "class": "COM1075", "comment": "If you are not on Glenny's good side, good luck. She has a clear bais towards students who she does not like, typically females, and tends to grade them more harshley. I can say withouth a doubt, she favored engineering students. She gave feedback publically. Overall, you should avoid Glenny if you can, she is very biased hard to understand.", "createdByUser": false, "date": "2025-04-08 02:01:40 +0000 UTC", "difficultyRating": 5, "flagStatus": "UNFLAGGED", "grade": "A", "helpfulRating": 2, "id": "UmF0aW5nLTQwODg5NzAx", "isForCredit": true, "isForOnlineClass": false, "legacyId": 40889701, "ratingTags": "Tough grader", "teacherNote": null, "textbookUse": 3, "thumbs": [], "thumbsDownTotal": 0, "thumbsUpTotal": 0, "wouldTakeAgain": null}}, {"cursor": "YXJyYXljb25uZWN0aW9uOjM=", "node": {"__typename": "Rating", "adminReviewedAt": "2025-03-15 19:10:03 +0000 UTC", "attendanceMandatory": "mandatory", "clarityRating": 2, "class": "SPE1075", "comment": "She grades very harshly on speeches in Public Speaking, so make sure you follow all of her guidelines. It's not about if you have a good speech, it's if she thinks you followed instructions well enough. Get on her good side.", "createdByUser": false, "date": "2025-03-15 19:09:43 +0000 UTC", "difficultyRating": 5, "flagStatus": "UNFLAGGED", "grade": "A", "helpfulRating": 2, "id": "UmF0aW5nLTQwNzc0NzY5", "isForCredit": true, "isForOnlineClass": false, "legacyId": 40774769, "ratingTags": "Tough grader--Group projects", "teacherNote": null, "textbookUse": 3, "thumbs": [], "thumbsDownTotal": 0, "thumbsUpTotal": 0, "wouldTakeAgain": null}}, {"cursor": "YXJyYXljb25uZWN0aW9uOjQ=", "node": {"__typename": "Rating", "adminReviewedAt": "2025-03-05 21:32:15 +0000 UTC", "attendanceMandatory": "mandatory", "clarityRating": 1, "class": "SPE1075", "comment": "I asked Prof. Glenny for an excused absence for my grandfather's FUNERAL, and she refused because it wasn't a school-related event. I know it wasn't an actual policy for the university because all my other professors gave me excused absences. \nShe also had clear biases and was the most condescending professor I have ever met.\n", "createdByUser": false, "date": "2025-03-05 21:32:04 +0000 UTC", "difficultyRating": 4, "flagStatus": "UNFLAGGED", "grade": "A", "helpfulRating": 1, "id": "UmF0aW5nLTQwNzM4OTMw", "isForCredit": true, "isForOnlineClass": false, "legacyId": 40738930, "ratingTags": "Tough grader", "teacherNote": null, "textbookUse": 3, "thumbs": [], "thumbsDownTotal": 0, "thumbsUpTotal": 0, "wouldTakeAgain": null}}], "pageInfo": {"endCursor": "YXJyYXljb25uZWN0aW9uOjQ=", "hasNextPage": true}}, "ratingsDistribution": {"r1": 14, "r2": 8, "r3": 0, "r4": 3, "r5": 6, "total": 31}, "relatedTeachers": [{"avgRating": 4.8, "firstName": "Laura", "id": "UmVsYXRlZFRlYWNoZXItMjcyNTU4Mg==", "lastName": "Watkins", "legacyId": 2725582}, {"avgRating": 2.2, "firstName": "Arlen (Skip)", "id": "UmVsYXRlZFRlYWNoZXItMjYyMjg1MQ==", "lastName": "Baumhoefner", "legacyId": 2622851}, {"avgRating": 5, "firstName": "Boyd", "id": "UmVsYXRlZFRlYWNoZXItNzg4NjA2", "lastName": "Seevers", "legacyId": 788606}], "school": {"avgRating": 0, "city": "Roseville", "country": "0-US-United States", "id": "U2Nob29sLTcwNg==", "isVisible": true, "legacyId": 706, "name": "University of Northwestern St. Paul", "numRatings": 117, "state": "MN"}, "teacherRatingTags": [], "wouldTakeAgainPercent": 30.7692}}}